WEBVTT

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.410
How pathetic...

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:21.080
Had I not disengaged myself at the last second, I would have perished.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Who ever thought I'd taste defeat on this planet at the ends of the universe?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.460
GaoGaiGar...

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.010
Hey, Pizza! Transform into light!

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.640
I am...

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.900
I am...

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.990
That's right...

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.410
I am...

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.870
I am a warrior!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.250
If I want to live as a warrior...

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.170
...and die as a warrior...

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.510
That means...

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.890
That means my battle isn't over yet!

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.980
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:36.080
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.800
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.080
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:52.000
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.920
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.720
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:02.480
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.650
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.190
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.320
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.280
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.360
Dividing Driver!

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:31.000
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.880
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.830
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.720
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.720
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.060
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:51.150
The Phoenix

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.440
<i>The Phoenix</i>

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:02.990
The Zonderians...

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.660
The Four Machine Kings have transformed the city of Tokyo...

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.040
...into a Zonder Metal Plant.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.840
To prevent the Zonderization of its 10 million inhabitants...

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:18.210
...the Brave Robots of GGG have gone into battle.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.550
In defeating the Four Machine Kings, they sustain grave damage...

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.180
...and even as the Brave Robots fall one by one...

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.220
...the Zonder Plant is completed!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.270
At this moment...

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.400
...mankind is about to experience the most terrible moment in history.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.740
Mic's ready to launch anytime, okay?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.110
What's the status on Disc X?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.320
I've finished loading it.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.950
The program is okay to go.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.410
Oh! Stallion!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.330
Hello, Swan!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:56.460
You see, Swan's big brother Stallion is one of the CR Project's top engineers.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.090
I asked him to come down here with me to disable...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.260
...Mic's System Change protection.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.180
Disable the protection?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.090
Yay!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.180
My brother!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.350
Hey! We don't have much time!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.020
Get that protection disabled!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.440
Okay.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.690
I'm really sorry about this, Mic the 13th.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:22.280
Until now, you had no control over your own boot system.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.780
But now I'm setting you free.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.990
Go out there and party like there's no tomorrow!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.080
What?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.010
Yay!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.220
System Change!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:59.020
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.240
Awesome, baby!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.400
Come on! Rock 'n' roll!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.450
Disc X!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.160
Set on!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.250
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.400
I'm detecting a highly-concentrated energy soliton!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.360
The Zonder Metal is being destroyed all throughout the capital!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.030
This is the true power of Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:55.040
Three days before the Zonderians launched their attack on Tokyo...

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.000
Dr. Liger Shishioh and Stallion White...

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.300
...were analyzing Mic Sounders' A.I. system in the US.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.970
Their goal was to pinpoint the reason why...

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.720
...Mic's protection had been disabled in Japan.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.350
Just as I thought!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.190
The 13th's true form is that Boom Robo Mode.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.860
But the solitary wave generated by Disc X...

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.570
...conceals a power so great that with one misstep...

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.610
...it could take out all of mankind.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:32.120
For that reason, this function was disabled to prevent him...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.790
...from reverting back to his normal mode, meaning the 13th himself...

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.290
...is unaware of his own transformation process.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:42.460
So you're saying that all those transformations since he got to Japan...

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.010
...were accidental?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.470
We're responsible for letting that happen.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.890
Dr. Liger, so you're saying that he was transforming for Swan?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.390
Absolutely!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:03.190
The 13th's A.I. System was modeled on Stallion's personality.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.110
Whenever Swan found herself in danger...

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.160
...Stallion's brotherly instincts embedded in Mic were so powerful...

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.910
...that they even broke through Mic's protection system.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.170
This was something even the great moi didn't foresee...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.340
So the secret that Mic had to keep at all costs...

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.760
It was this power, right?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.300
Exactly.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:35.180
The solitary wave loaded inside the Mic Sounders Series...

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.430
...can penetrate physical objects at the atomic level...

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.600
...and destroys it by tuning to its frequency.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.730
As long as he knows the enemy's atomic structure...

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.780
...theoretically there's nothing he can't destroy!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:52.700
I see. So that's why you stole the GGG battle data.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.740
It was for your research, huh?

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.120
Oh, my, so you were onto me?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.450
Of course I was!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.290
All right, then where's the Zonder Metal I loaned you?

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.540
Since I used it in my solitary wave experiment, it's shattered now.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:12.470
What! That was a precious sample!

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.800
If we can have this power...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.060
...then mankind can triumph over the Zonderians!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.520
Darn you! Come back here!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.850
No way! You think I'm out of my mind?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.150
Give it back!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.560
It's gone!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:29.360
Disc X's target was Zonder Metal and nothing else.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.490
It can't destroy any other substance!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.830
So this is Mic's true power.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.340
Transmission complete!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.470
All traces of Elementary Particle Z0 have been nullified.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.850
It's a miracle!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.220
All of the Zonder Metal has been completely destroyed!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.020
It's all over, ChoRyuJin.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:10.270
Captain...

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.490
Still...

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.030
That robot...

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.330
Mankind has been saved!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:37.010
We're now going to launch a rescue operation to aid the city's victims!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.310
Ultra-Technology Laboratory, launch!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.940
Ul-Tech Engine, on!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.780
Triple-decked Flying Carrier, separate and launch!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.360
We're on our way to retrieve GaoGaiGar and ChoRyuJin!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.170
And which of you robots is going to Mamoru's rescue?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.340
Hey, I'll take that job!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.250
The 13th?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:18.430
But your energy is nearly exhausted from using the Solitary Wave.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.140
I'll be okay if I revert to Cosmo Robo form!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.310
System Change!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.280
Mic's friends will be saved by Mic, okay?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.490
Baribarien... on!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.540
My, my...

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:56.590
Still, I wonder why hasn't that land uplift gone back to normal yet...

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.430
Entohji, what's the status on Volfogg?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:05.890
Since the demise of EI-27, I've lost contact.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.020
We all know Volfogg, though. I'm sure he's alive and well somewhere.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.820
Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle...

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.360
...Triple-decked Flying Carrier now making contact!

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.280
We're now going to retrieve GaiGaiGar and ChoRyuJin.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.080
The battle between our heroes at GGG and the Four Machine Kings...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.830
...is about to come to an end.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.130
But at this time, no one has a clue that this was...

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:43.510
...only the prelude to a terrible, bloodcurdling final battle...

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.060
All right, Mom! I'll be waiting here like a good boy, okay?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.400
I wonder where Mamoru is?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.660
Ikumi?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.200
Everybody! I'm here to rescue you!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.160
Everybody! I'm here to rescue you! Mic!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.580
Could you all take a step back?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.130
You're all gonna get on my Baribarien, okay?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.520
What? Okay, everybody, let's move fast now!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:32.690
Hana!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.940
Come on, you guys. How many times are you gonna make me do it?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.450
Hey, where's Mamoru?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.370
Well, you see, he ran off somewhere...

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.290
Oh! Unbelievable!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:56.630
Chief, I wonder if you remember? That incident two years ago?

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.290
How could I ever forget?

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.720
That was the day that this nightmare began for mankind.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:07.050
That day, when EI-01 fell to the ground in Yokohama...

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.930
...he managed to vanish somewhere by traveling underground.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.560
EI-01?

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.140
Don't tell me...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.480
Receiving an alert from the Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.520
It's Gai!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.820
Gai! Can you hear me, Gai?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.570
What do you think you're doing?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.620
You need to undergo maintenance!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.620
Mamoru's always helped us protect the planet...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.960
...without ever giving a thought to his own safety!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.590
Now it's GGG's turn to rescue Mamoru!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.600
Just be safe, Mamoru!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.610
This feeling...

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.530
I'm getting a really huge, horrible feeling!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:16.460
So you've finally come? The Machine of Destruction created by Cain...

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:18.500
Cain?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.250
Machine...

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.500
...of Destruction?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.900
Even if I am unable to lay a finger on you myself...

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.320
...I can still seal you away.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:51.450
If two beings of diametrically opposed energies collide...

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.580
...the one with less power will be the first to expire!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:59.120
Therefore, I cannot afford to waste any energy on you now.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.670
Mic's gonna go find Mamoru, okay?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.460
We're counting on you, Mic!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.340
Find him no matter what, okay?

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.010
Yo! That's all right!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.350
Wait...

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.520
Hey, have you seen Ikumi?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.430
Come to think of it, I don't see him.

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:22.190
Don't tell me we left him behind too?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:23.270
Huh?

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.940
Mamoru!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.610
There's something fishy about this hole!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.950
Oh, no!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.790
Are you all right, Mic?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:42.710
C-Captain Gai? Mamoru's gone, Mamoru's gone!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.380
So it's a barrier?

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:48.960
Galeon!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.430
Is he...

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.190
That day two years ago...

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.900
...Galeon smashed through EI-01's barrier the same way.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.820
And then he set off an explosion by drilling a hole in the engine...

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.440
...and caused EI-01 to fall to Earth.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:17.410
If I'm not mistaken, the Melting Siren uses the same technology...

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:25.460
All right!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.880
Captain Gai...

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:38.220
Galeon!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.180
Curses! Cain's Legacy...

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.520
Galeon!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.740
Who knew there was a place like this underneath the Tokyo Tower?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.700
I've been waiting for you, Cyborg.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.000
Pizza!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.160
So you survived?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.330
I won't die until I've crushed the life out of you!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.840
I don't have time to fool around with you!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.510
You put up a good fight.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:16.720
And now I'm the only surviving member of the Four Machine Kings.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.390
I urge you to try and defeat me. To defeat Pizza!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:24.690
That will be your passport for what lies ahead... your passport to hell!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.570
What's the matter, Cyborg?

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.120
At that pitiful speed, you can't possibly defeat me!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.090
Hyper Mode!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.970
That's right! That's right! That's the power I was looking for!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.260
After all, there'd be no point in defeating a weakened cyborg!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:17:59.720
Don't mess with me!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.390
Will Knife!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.310
This is one battle I can't lose!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.230
So quick!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.070
Impressive...

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.900
Even so, victory shall be mine!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.260
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.350
I can't go down just yet, don't you get it?

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.410
This is bad! I'm out of time!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:02.660
I win!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.370
I can't spread my wings.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.830
You're coming with me all the way to hell!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.310
Big Brother Gai!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:32.690
Mamoru!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.190
Who are you?

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.110
Library!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.570
So you're Pasdar!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.870
Are you the Zonderian boss who was manipulating the Four Machine Kings?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.290
I am not obligated to answer that.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.750
Big Brother Gai!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:57.750
Oh, man...

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:01.170
I've hardly got any energy left because of that battle with Pizza...

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.590
You shall be smashed into a thousand pieces!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:09.810
Pizza!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:14.020
After all, I still haven't settled the score with you...

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.030
To think that you'd rebel against me.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:23.360
But I suppose that's the fate of the weak-willed.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:28.660
I was only looking for a place where I could die as a warrior.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.750
That's right...

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:34.330
Gai, thanks to you, I remembered something important.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.580
I thank you for that.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.260
That's right...

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:41.840
I was...

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.630
I was...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.890
What do you think you're doing, Pizza?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.020
My name is not Pizza!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:54.730
My name is...

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.940
Pizza!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.710
The sky is divine...

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.210
The sky is indeed divine...

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.460
When I die...

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.340
...it should be up above the sky...

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:24.550
...it should be up above the sky...

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.560
Big Brother Gai!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.310
Sorry I didn't get here sooner, Mamoru.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.650
I knew you'd be coming for me!

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:40.820
You, too, Galeon!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.530
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.830
This fear that you brought onto yourselves...

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.120
...you shall experience it to the fullest!

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.290
A gigantic entity is emerging from underneath the Tokyo Tower!

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.590
But that's... it can't be!

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.010
Right, that's exactly what it is!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.100
EI-01!

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.520
EI-01...

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:21.940
The intelligent alien life-form that first appeared two years ago...

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:23.900
Classification No. 1...

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:41.210
The final battle between mankind and Pasdar is about to begin!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:48.190
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:50.530
Defeat EI-01!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.240
At last, the Ultimate Projectile, Bullet X has been approved for launch.

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.620
But is this a one-way ticket to destiny?

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.200
As our brave robots go into their final battle...

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:02.080
...won't you give them some of your own burning courage?

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.670
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:06.710
"Brave Robots, Death at Dawn!"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
Brave Robots, Death at Dawn!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:10.130
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
Projectile X

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:14.840
This is the Key to Victory!
